msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_1_title"
msgid "Step 1: Connect your CRM"
msgstr "Passaggio 1: collega il tuo CRM"

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_1_instruction.marketplace"
msgid "<p>Make sure that your CRM sends files to the marketplace. You can connect 1C or any other CRM that supports CommerceML.</p><p>We'll tick this checkbox once the marketplace receives and processes the first file from your CRM. Here are the instructions how you can connect your CRM:</p>"
msgstr "<p>Assicurati che il tuo CRM invii i file al marketplace. Puoi collegare 1C o qualsiasi altro CRM che supporti CommerceML.</p><p>Spuntaremo questa casella non appena il marketplace riceverà ed elaborerà il primo file dal tuo CRM. Ecco le istruzioni su come collegare il tuo CRM:</p>"

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_1_instruction.store"
msgid "<p>Make sure that your CRM sends files to the store. You can connect 1C or any other CRM that supports CommerceML.</p><p>We'll tick this checkbox once the store receives and processes the first file from your CRM. Here are the instructions how you can connect your CRM:</p>"
msgstr "<p>Assicurati che il tuo CRM invii i file al negozio. Puoi collegare 1C o qualsiasi altro CRM che supporti CommerceML.</p><p>Spuntare questa casella non appena il negozio riceverà ed elaborerà il primo file dal tuo CRM. Ecco le istruzioni su come collegare il tuo CRM:</p>"

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_1_links"
msgid "<a href=\"[docs_url]user_guide/addons/commerceml/1c/\">1C Trade Management</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"[docs_url]user_guide/addons/commerceml/1c/\">Gestione commerciale 1C</a>"

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_2_title"
msgid "Step 2: Set the data exchange rules"
msgstr "Passaggio 2: Impostare le regole di scambio dati"

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_2_instruction.marketplace"
msgid "<p>Before importing anything, the marketplace checks the content of your CRM file. You decide what data to use, and how to use it. One you set the rules for matching the data from your file with the data in the marketplace, you'll be able to import it.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Prima di importare qualsiasi dato, il marketplace verifica il contenuto del tuo file CRM. Decidi quali dati utilizzare e come utilizzarli. Una volta impostate le regole per la corrispondenza tra i dati del tuo file e i dati presenti nel marketplace, potrai importarli.</p>"

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_2_instruction.store"
msgid "<p>Before importing anything, the store checks the content of your CRM file. You decide what data to use, and how to use it. One you set the rules for matching the data from your file with the data in the store, you'll be able to import it.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Prima di importare qualsiasi dato, il negozio controlla il contenuto del tuo file CRM. Decidi quali dati utilizzare e come utilizzarli. Una volta impostate le regole per la corrispondenza tra i dati del tuo file e i dati presenti nel negozio, potrai importarli.</p>"

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_2_specify_matches"
msgid "Please specify the matches for:"
msgstr "Si prega di specificare le corrispondenze per:"

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_3_title"
msgid "Step 3: Synchronize the data"
msgstr "Passaggio 3: Sincronizzare i dati"

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_3_instruction.marketplace"
msgid "<p>Once you set the rules, data can be imported. Start the import from your CRM. We'll tick this checkbox after the marketplace successfully receives the data. If there're any issues, we'll notify you here.</p>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "Languages::commerceml.step_3_instruction.store"
msgid "<p>Once you set the rules, data can be imported. Start the import from your CRM. We'll tick this checkbox after the store successfully receives the data. If there're any issues, we'll notify you here.</p>"
msgstr ""

